ts: DET 5/5 DROP/ICE, OKC 6/4, PHX 5/2, SAS 8/6; BOS and PHI zero ICE_CANDIDATE. Confidence floor ICE  [cut; read_family for the full text]", "auto_failure_mechanism": "A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)", "observed_failure_evidence": "NBA v3 feed does not populate switchesOn (759 rows, all zero); ICE_CANDIDATE not confirmed ICE without screen-contact tracking; HEDGE/TRAP/ZONE unlabeled.", "observed_verdict": "tool_eval_fail"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:label_or_classification_error"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:LABEL_ERROR"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-PAP-030", "label": "Study family SF-PAP-030: Defensive reorganizer on/off: opponent fingerprint vs PPP allowed", "score": 0.446, "reached_via": ["request matches RQC:RQC-147 (0.71); FAM:SF-PAP-030 auto_addresses_question RQC:RQC-147"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Defensive reorganizer on/off: opponent fingerprint vs PPP allowed", "auto_outcome_status": "rejected", "observed_hypothesis": "Defenders who displace the opponent's initiation fingerprint (high D_A) also suppress opponent PPP.", "observed_result": "eligible 653/882; corr(D_A, n_on) all=-0.475 vs eligible=-0.036; eligible median D_A=0.0529, median dPPP_allowed=-0.298; corr(D_A, dPPP_allowed)=+0.020; quadrants ~161-166 each", "auto_failure_mechanism": "B_powered_null (adequately powered null result)", "observed_failure_evidence": "among 653 eligible, corr(D_A, dPPP_allowed)=+0.020; high-D_A names (Isaiah Joe 0.168, Trey Lyles 0.157) often allow more PPP", "observed_sample_and_power": "n=653 eligible of 882", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED", "observed_verdict": "null", "observed_failure_type": "B_powered_null"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:MECHANICAL_FLOOR"}, {"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF-PAP-014"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-048", "label": "Study family SF-APPA-048: Player-level BEST vs AVOID H2 P